{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/pulls/13","id":4864220806,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU5afPs8AAAABIe4ehg","html_url":"https://github.com/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/pull/13","diff_url":"https://github.com/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/pull/13.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/pull/13.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/issues/13","number":13,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Verifica lifetime nativo delle fonti GET e reclaim EBR","user":{"login":"gpicchiarelli","id":1062111,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjIxMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1062111?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli","html_url":"https://github.com/gpicchiarelli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Un GET già ammesso può continuare a usare un CLOSED durante la pubblicazione di nuove fonti; il FD viene chiuso solo dopo l'uscita da EBR. Aggiunge quattro casi v1/v2 con I/O nativo, superset prima delle nuove location, riduzione controllata delle fonti, claim negato durante lettura/copia e cleanup prima del reclaim su errore o uscita non locale.\n\nNessuna modifica al prodotto o ai formati. Metodo preregistrato e prove originali conservate, comprese tre cache ASDF e il primo tentativo completo fallito su un'asserzione temporale CBOR preesistente; non viene attribuita una causa esterna.\n\nValidazione locale: suite directory GET 72/72; `make check` R2 con 1.410 test in 32 suite e due smoke test, senza warning. Audit indipendente di nomi, sorgenti e copie integrali. Catalogo durabile, retention generale e rotazione completa restano aperti.\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:40:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T20:40:29Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"92dc4aa0312b6cc1df37e202f414b75742d6fc1c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/pulls/13/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/pulls/13/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/issues/13/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gpicchiarelli/ArcDocDB/statuses/2001940952f6477b2db487f4662900139b0de20d","head":{"label":"gpicchiarelli:codex/get-source-lifetime","ref":"codex/get-source-lifetime","sha":"2001940952f6477b2db487f4662900139b0de20d","user":{"login":"gpicchiarelli","id":1062111,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjIxMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1062111?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli","html_url":"https://github.com/gpicchiarelli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpicchiarelli/orgs","repos_url":"ht